	(text "The MAX3483 is a slewrate limited equivalent of the MAX3485 (250kBit instead of 2.5 MBit).\nLower slewrate results in a cleaner XpressNet signal (less ringing).\nThe DIP-8 version of the MAX3483 is relatively expensive, however."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.09 92.964 0)
		(effects
